    "title": "Daraz Online Shopping App",
    "creator": "Daraz Mobile",
    "descriptionHtml": "<center><h2><b><i>★★★ Welcome to the Daraz app! ★★★</i></b></h2></center><br><br>With up to 4 million daily users, you’re in very good company.<br>Daraz is the leading online marketplace in South Asia, empowering tens of thousands of sellers to connect with millions of customers.<br><br>Daraz is a Mall, a Marketplace, and a Community in your pocket that provides immediate and easy access to 21 million products in more than 257 categories.<br><br>Our “Mobile Week” campaign in June will present great discounts and deals from your favourite brands across a variety of categories  including mobile phones, tablets, accessories, televisions, audio systems, cameras, computing products, gaming consoles and PCs, gaming accessories and much more!<br><br><b>MEGA DEALS</b><br>Our mega deals are focus, deeply discounted deals that are a steal for the price! Make sure you checkout while they’re still in stock.<br><br><b>INSTANT MESSAGING</b><br>Now you can directly talk to our sellers and collect meaningful answers to any questions you might have before completing your purchase<br><br><b>SHAKE SHAKE</b><br>Shake the Daraz App at our designated time-slots to win amazing vouchers and giveaways!<br><br><b>JUST FOR YOU</b><br>Daraz app knows your choice! Our personalised app uses artificial intelligence to help you find exactly what you are looking for.<br><br><b>EASY RETURNS &amp; REFUNDS</b><br>Purchase Protection is the biggest commitment we give to our customers. Manage and track your orders, and easily initiate returns and refunds!<br><br><b>VOUCHER DISCOUNTS</b><br>Our vouchers section offers new discounts from brands and sellers everyday - use now or collect them in your wallet!<br><br><b>DAILY FLASH SALES</b><br>Our 24/7 Flash Sales offer big discounts on top selling products. With limited time and stock, it’s fastest fingers first!<br><br><b>DARAZMALL</b><br>DarazMall is your doorway to our 300 top brands that are committed to top-quality products, fast shipping and a 14-day return policy!<br><br><b>TOP-UP &amp; eSTORE</b><br>Shop from our &#39;digital&#39; products to find the best deals near you or top-up your phone with any local mobile network operator.<br><br><b>DARAZ WALLET</b><br>Daraz Wallet is the fastest way to checkout with instant refunds and exclusive deposit bonuses!<br><br><b>EASY &amp; SECURE CHECKOUT</b><br>Our PCI-DSS compliant technology ensures smooth and safe payment of your purchase.<br><br><b>NOTIFICATIONS &amp; MESSAGES</b><br>Enable Notifications to receive updates from your favourite brands and exclusive deals on the app!<br><br><b>GLOBAL COLLECTION</b><br>Choose from over 1,000,000 overseas products, many of which cannot be found in Pakistan. Pay for global products in PKR with any of our payment options, including Cash on Delivery with no hidden charges.<br><br><b>RATINGS &amp; REVIEWS</b><br>Our community-driven ratings and reviews allow you to thoroughly verify your purchases and access real experiences from past customers.<br><br><center><b>Happy Shopping!</b></center><br> <br>We’d love your Feedback! Also, if you face any technical issues, drop us a line at support.app@daraz.com<br><br>*DARAZ IS ONLY OPERATIONAL IN PAKISTAN, BANGLADESH, SRI LANKA AND NEPAL*",
